AB  - In the process of communication network management, with the increase of user's demand for application network, the management architecture gradually generates various management modules, and each module independently completes the task. This process is relatively simple and easy to implement and saves a part of the physical space, but the data inside the system is chaotic and scattered, and the functions between data blocks are mostly repeated, which poses a serious threat to the maintenance and upgrade of the 5G communication network management system. For the above reason we try to use micro service architecture for 5 G communication network management system of each module for unified control, ensure that in the process of frequent data communication implements the function of optimization. At the same time, predicting the application of knowledge map in data relations also helps us to better the hierarchy between each data block. It contributes to the normal operation of the network management system. The experimental results on the benchmark data show that the method has excellent performance and good stability. © 2021 IEEE.
